# Isaiah, for the novel
cols:
k: What it gives TKC
The Empire's grandest liturgical language and its sharpest indictment in one scroll. Also the servant, authority through humiliation, the one model of power Dominion can't use.
||
kp: What Dominion would do
POSSIBLE: Quote the coming king constantly and never read chapter one aloud. The promise to eunuchs and foreigners gets footnoted as future and spiritual.
/end
