A working model for an underground network: house meetings, women as hosts and patrons, decisions reached by argument and a shared purse. Everything the resistance needs, sourced from scripture.
||
kp: What Dominion would do
POSSIBLE: Read it as the founding of the institution and drop the story of an unlicensed movement. The shared property becomes a temporary emergency measure, and the women's houses become hospitality.
/end
